  "title": "KFC's KPRO Tops 300 Locations in China",
  "summary": "SHANGHAI, May 22, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Yum China Holdings, Inc. (the \"Company\" or \" Yum China \") (NYSE: YUMC and HKEX: 9987) announced that KFC's light-meal concept, KPRO, has surpassed 300 locations in China and is on track to reach 600 locations by year–end, up from just over 200 in 2025.",
